'''''Delphinium gracile''''' is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Ranunculaceae]], native to the western Mediterranean.<ref name="POWO_710647-1" >{{cite POWO |id=710647-1 |title=''Delphinium gracile'' DC. |access-date=15 January 2024 }}</ref> A [[diterpenoid]] alkaloid, graciline, has been isolated from its tissues.<ref>{{cite journal |title=The structure of graciline, a new diterpenoid alkaloid from ''Delphinium gracile'' |date=1984 |last1=g. González |first1=Antonio |last2=de la Fuente |first2=Gabriel |last3=Reina |first3=Matías |last4=Timón |first4=Isabel |journal=Heterocycles |volume=22 |issue=4 |pages=667–669 |doi=10.3987/R-1984-04-0667 |doi-access=free }}</ref>

